                                "sense_id": "61266ab0-69ce-3904-b900-4f95207490fd",
                                "text": "The two are immediately caught up in a terrorist plot to rid the earth of its underclass, and this gives Nobby the chance to live out a James Bond fantasy of Englishness, with his own lager-swilling twist."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6878513f-d117-4c24-b50b-e4f2c6a8c697",
                                "sense_id": "61266ab0-69ce-3904-b900-4f95207490fd",
                                "text": "Still, among New York’s creative underclass — cash poor but culturally potent — it feels like everything but socialism is now irrelevant."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "91a840ae-84d3-40bf-9e9d-89267d39cd24",
                                "sense_id": "61266ab0-69ce-3904-b900-4f95207490fd",
                                "text": "While there are reasons to be optimistic about this trend, there is also something queasy about the emergence of a new underclass of urban servants."
                            }
                        ]
